# The repository root ignores every `oracle/` directory (the C# oracle output); this one is SOURCE.
!oracle/
oracle/node_modules/
# the oracle pins its tools exactly; its lockfile is part of the ground truth (root ignores package-lock.json)
!oracle/package-lock.json
# Fixture trees are content, whatever their directory names: the root ignores target/, dist/, out/, build/, lib/ …
# by name, and a fixture that models such a directory (refs/08 links into target/) must still be committed.
# run-tests.sh refuses to run while any file under cases/ is git-ignored.
!cases/**
!expected/**
